==Description==
The '''Butterflies Nametag''' is a nametag that could be obtained at Level 21 of the premium [[Ducky Revenge Event#Ducky Revenge Battle Pass|Ducky Revenge Battle Pass]] track. At that Level, it had a cost of {{DuckyEggs|670}} or {{Robux|72}} ({{Robux|61}} during the Memorial Day 2025 Sale) to unlock it, with a total cost of {{DuckyEggs|6,760}} or {{Robux|1,492}}  ({{Robux|1,258}} during the Memorial Day 2025 Sale).

The '''Butterflies Nametag''' has has an orange to pink gradient text and outline. Behind the text, there are orange and pink waves which move up and down. Multiple small pink and orange butterflies, alongside bigger more realistic butterflies can be seen coming out of the text.

